cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "OPPTI Immune Evasion Atlas"
abstract: >
  End-to-end reproducible pipeline for pan-cancer proteogenomic outlier
  analysis of immune-evasion proteins (OPPTI) across nine CPTAC cancer types,
  RNA–protein concordance quantification of post-transcriptional immune
  evasion, and PIES-DSS — an RNA-only immune-checkpoint-blockade response
  classifier whose per-gene prior is proteomic RNA-invisibility and whose
  module weights are learned inside nested cross-validation, validated in
  three independent ICB cohorts.
authors:
